    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a pixelated world full of obstacles and impossible platforms, you take control of a little slime whose only mission is to reach the top. Every jump counts, every mistake has consequences. There is no room to give up: only skill, patience and determination. Can you lead the slime to glory without falling into despair?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724380/extras/1b524023f524e2466eba7ac3167b8442.avif?t=1750444089\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p>",
